# Intent: Identify lineage edges carrying SECRET-classified data within an IL4
#         boundary, where SECRET data is prohibited. Any SECRET-tagged edge in a
#         CUI/IL4 lineage graph represents a data-flow policy violation that must
#         be remediated before the next authorization boundary review.
# Expected violation shape: rows where classification == "SECRET";
#   each row is a lineage edge transporting SECRET data through a CUI pipeline.

foreach e in data.lineage.edges
  where e.classification == "SECRET"
  select e.id, e.source_node_id, e.target_node_id, e.classification, e.design_id
